Black Stained Glass=Svartfarga glas
White Stained Glass=Kvitfarga glas
Yellow Stained Glass=Gulfarga glas
Brown Stained Glass=Brunfarga glas
Orange Stained Glass=Oransjefarga glas
Pink Stained Glass=Rosafarga glas
Grey Stained Glass=Gråfarga glas
Lime Stained Glass=Limegrønfarga glas
Light Grey Stained Glass=Ljosegråfarga glas
Magenta Stained Glass=Ljoselillafarga glas
